# Lonestar6 knowledge base

This project runs H-OPD on **TACC Lonestar6**. Before SSH, `idev`, path, or install advice, read `docs/LS6.md`.

When a job reveals a durable fact, append it to `docs/LS6.md` in the same turn.

Trainer is a nested clone at `verl/` (gitignored), GitHub [rishuray123/verl](https://github.com/rishuray123/verl), branch **`hopd`** to run (from frozen `ls6`). Do not use `$SCRATCH/opdl/` from the MATH OPDL project.

Venvs, HF cache, parquet, and checkpoints belong on `$SCRATCH`, never `$WORK`.
